Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and July to August came in under 90% of normal in 43 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 34% of normal in September to October, the wettest pair, and 46% in July to August. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 12% and May to June at 254%. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, with grid 9132 at 34%.</p>"}
